TITLE Barite saturation index with temperature increase from 25 to 95 C in 5 steps

SOLUTION 1
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mg/L
    Ba        2.0
    S(6)      15.0 as SO4

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    25.0  35.0  50.0  65.0  80.0  95.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     barite_temp.sel
    -temperature  true
    -si       Barite

END
